data: {"id": "1c61ca53ff9d423f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1939", "run_id": "1c61ca53ff9d423f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我将基于已采集的真实工具事实，对 `aiops-case-11/workload` 的 TerminatingStuck 状态进行根因分析。\n\n## 1. 实体身份与生命周期确认\n\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-11/workload`\n- **UID**: `98974b5c-1ddf-4f28-83ab-c916c5fb975d`\n- **Phase**: `Running`（但状态为 `Terminating`，持续 58 分钟）\n- **deletionTimestamp**: `2026-09-11T03:47:07Z`\n- **deletionGracePeriodSeconds**: `0`\n- **nodeName**: `node2`\n\n**关键事实**：Pod 的 `deletionTimestamp` 已设置（即删除请求已发出），但 Pod 一直处于 `Terminating` 状态长达 58 分钟未真正消失。\n\n## 2. TerminatingStuck 根因证据\n\n### 支持的证据：\n\n1. **finalizers: `aiops.lab", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789101971620, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

